
This repo is conactenation of two: Root-My-Pixel and Root-My-Pixel-Pixel6a.

This is the only solution for Google Pixel 8a (akita, build id: CP2A.260805.005)
The phone ws locked to the T-Mobile US / Sprint network ecosystem, but configured to allow specific virtual operators (MVNOs) and sub-brands via GID1 (Group Identifier 1) codes.

Files:
./modules/ksud-pixel - extracted from assets from Root-My-Pixel apk: assets/ksud/ksud
./binaries/app.so - extracted from assets from Root-My-Pixel apk: assets/exploits/akita-CP2A.260805.005.so
./binaries/helper - taken from Root-My-Pixel-Pixel6a: binaries/cve-2026-43499-root
./modules/akita-CP2A.260805.005.ksym.tsv - extracted from Pixel 8a kernel image
./modules/android14-6.1_kernelsu_v3.3.0.ko - taken from Root-My-Pixel-Pixel6a: ksun/android14-6.1_kernelsu_v3.3.0.ko
./modules/patch_ko.py - - taken from Root-My-Pixel-Pixel6a: ksun/patch_ko.py
./tools/carrier-unlock/carrier-unlock.jar - built from from Root-My-Pixel-Pixel6a
